0..77 Comment "//! The ranges of `boot-core` over `Ptr.Eff`, the answer of a search, and the"
78..147 Comment "//! lists of bytes that the `runs` items put in a memory of `Extent`."
148..151 Comment "//!"
152..230 Comment "//! A range is the address of its first byte and its length. The length counts"
231..307 Comment "//! the bytes one step at a time, so a function over a range descends on its"
308..385 Comment "//! length. A loop that counts down a word holds its counter across a load or"
386..442 Comment "//! a store, which a handler may resume other than once."
443..446 Comment "//!"
447..515 Comment "//! - see: `../../../crates/boot-core/src/lib.rs` — the Rust types"
